<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia MIDF year net 161.85 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia MIDF year net 161.85 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 161.85   vs	 112.62</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 25.5    vs	  24.0</p>
<p>    Total income	     501.48   vs	 416.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   312.07   vs	 199.39</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 36.56   vs  less  19.73</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    2.02   vs	   1.75</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 7.0    vs	   7.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysian Industrial Development Finance Bhd is involved in finance, leasing, share-registry and share issue services, and commercial and merchant banking.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
